  "releaseNotes": "- Initial release of Nalix.Storage.\n      - Features include:\n      • Support for multiple file formats and MIME type detection.\n      • Configurable file storage providers for flexibility.\n      • Local storage management for optimized file handling.\n      • Interfaces for synchronous (IFileStorage) and asynchronous (IFileStorageAsync) operations.\n      • Stream provider (IStreamProvider) for efficient file streaming.",
